      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To catch those elusive bugs, heavily invest in advanced testing techniques like chaos engineering and end-to-end user flow testing within the Staging environment. Integrate static application security testing (SAST) tools deep into your pipeline to find subtle logic flaws and security vulnerabilities the tests might miss. Furthermore, implement feature flagging so new code deploys dark, allowing you to monitor real-world impact before it's exposed to all users.",
